# Belt and braces. The repository root .gitignore already excludes every image
# extension at any depth, but this directory is where evidence actually lives
# and a new format should never be committable just because nobody remembered
# to add its extension upstream.
#
# Ignore everything here, then allow back only the two documents that let the
# corpus be rebuilt.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!TEST_RESULTS.md
